    "sections": {
        "description": "Need a website for your pest control business but don’t want a headache? STPestControl is a solid Pest Control WordPress theme that’s clean, fast, and easy to set up. The design uses simple green and white colours, nothing flashy, just something that looks professional and makes sense. What’s nice is that it works well on everything, phones, laptops, whatever. You don’t need to worry about resizing stuff or things breaking. It just fits. Pages load quickly, too, so visitors aren’t left staring at a blank screen. It also plays well with popular plugins. Want to use Elementor to tweak the layout? Go for it. Need SEO tools like Yoast to help show up on Google? No problem. It’s compatible with most of the plugins you probably already use. You don’t need to be a web expert to make it work. Just install the Pest Control WordPress theme, add your content, and you’re good to go. It’s not trying to be fancy, it’s just a theme that does its job without getting in the way."
    },
